{'symbol': 'KEY', 'date': '2021-03-12 08:07:00', 'title': 'KEYBANK ANNOUNCES $40B INVESTMENT IN COMMUNITIES INCLUDING AFFORDABLE HOUSING, ECONOMIC INCLUSION, AND CLIMATE CHANGE FUNDING COMMITMENTS', 'text': 'CLEVELAND, MARCH 12, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BUILDING ON EARLY FULFILLMENT OF ITS GROUNDBREAKING $16.5 BILLION COMMUNITY BENEFITS PLAN, KEYBANK TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL INCREASE ITS COMMITMENT TO $40 BILLION. THE INVESTMENTS WILL CONTINUE TO FOCUS ON ECONOMIC ACCESS AND EQUITY FOR UNDERSERVED COMMUNITIES AND POPULATIONS.'}